WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Modern QA teams lose valuable sprint cycles

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.550
manually mapping complex screens and constantly maintaining fragile UI test scripts.

3
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:13.200
PiOne Testmate scans authorised web applications.

4
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.250
discovering navigation routes and interactive UI controls while preserving comprehensive evidence.

5
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.800
With evidence-grounded test planning.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.190
generated test cases link directly to verified DOM elements and selectors. preventing hallucinated locators.

7
00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:32.800
Through interactive checkpoints. testers can guide discovery.

8
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.980
teach key workflows. and safely quarantine risky actions before deep crawling.

9
00:00:37.980 --> 00:00:43.100
Execute tests with live assertion streaming and per-step screenshots.

10
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:48.690
Export ten-sheet Excel workbooks. save checkpoints. and compare regression baselines.

11
00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:55.290
PiOne Testmate — evidence-first AI QA for controlled. explainable test automation.
